d":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"cIBr1KeRLTpgvTpF8z2nFQ","review_id":"GEiW6fZIkF3r1RXSt2ZWDQ","date":"2019-08-14T22:52:08","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9358641505241394,"text_excerpt":"Cool hole in the wall off the main strip. They have $3 Jell-O shots that are more than worth it. They have a good selection of drinks as well. We ordered some apps and a few chili dogs and I was impressed with their food for a dive bar. The bartenders are pretty cool as well. I would go back for sure! Cheers!"},{"business_id":"cIBr1KeRLTpgvTpF8z2nFQ","review_id":"ktUyfQNmwVmWxuDrM0qaFg","date":"2014-12-30T18:00:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.931101381778717,"text_excerpt":"Sooooo...once upon a time I was drunk and walking through the French Quarters with friends. We were hungry and wanted to wind down with a few drinks. Not many places are open late but this late night haunt was one of them. We thought we would give it a try. Well for starters it looks like a typical dive bar but the first thing I noticed was the staff and the people there were super nice and laid back. They also had some music going. I was going to order a drink until I discovered they had a large beer selection. So I tried the Strawberry Cider beer which was soooo tasty. I was very pleased. I ordered a hot dog and seasoned fries thinking it would be whatever but it was anything but that. ..."},{"business_id":"cIBr1KeRLTpgvTpF8z2nFQ","review_id":"hOtsHUj-vB0BLkC5mXEEPQ","date":"2015-08-30T02:42:14","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9308403134346008,"text_excerpt":"The BBQ Shrimp poboy was incredible here! Our barmaid, \"Z\", was very friendly and personable. She made sure we had ABSOLUTELY EVERYTHING we needed. When my wife (who doesn't drink much) asked her for new types of drinks, she explained everything and made sure she wanted it before pouring it. She was on top of everything! The atmosphere was kinda divey, just the way I like it. I feel like even though tons of tourists come here, this is a local hang. I dig it!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"cIBr1KeRLTpgvTpF8z2nFQ","photo_id":"IFCz1kgac11pNKOdRW2BaQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/IFCz1kgac11pNKOdRW2BaQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8958683013916016},{"business_id":"cIBr1KeRLTpgvTpF8z2nFQ","photo_id":"oxfW0ePuZF2dVPp7LNKgGw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/oxfW0ePuZF2dVPp7LNKgGw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8958682417869568}]},"notebook_case":null}
